.inc CoilcraftTemplates.lib

*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 1008CT-040
* Inductance = 4nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-13.7GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor RF Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 1008CT-040 port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.041pF Ind=4nH
X1 port1 port2 Model2A PARAMS:
+ R1=13
+ R2=0.15
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.0000058
+ K3= {Ind}
.ends 1008CT-040

